<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>写轮眼主题</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>写轮眼素材</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>填 /Library/KZTheme/eye/ 里的文件名（不带 .png）。默认 sharingan = 写轮眼，填 dot 就是普通圆点。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>素材文件名</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>eye</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>sharingan</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>sharingan</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.kztheme</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>倒数 3-2-1 样式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>录屏开始前系统倒数 3 秒时显示的图案。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkListCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>样式</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>countdown</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>B</string>
			<key>detail</key>
			<string>PSListItemsController</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.kztheme</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<string>A</string>
				<string>B</string>
				<string>C</string>
			</array>
			<key>titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>A 标准（六边形白点）</string>
				<string>B 彩色数字（推荐）</string>
				<string>C 彩色秒表</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>大小与转速</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>大小：0.6 已经是系统槽位上限，再大就会被裁掉。转速：秒数，越大转得越慢（1.5 = 1.5 秒转一圈）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>大小 scale</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>scale</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>0.6</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>0.6</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.kztheme</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>转速 duration</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>duration</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>1.5</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>1.5</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.kztheme</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>点下面「应用」把设置写进挂载目录。写完后开始录屏就能看到；如果还是旧样子，去 Dopamine 注销一次。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>applyNow</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
